/** @mainpage stlab-execution

Standalone task execution, executors, timers, and process lifecycle.

@details
This unpublished extraction owns the canonical `stlab/concurrency/task.hpp`,
executor and timer headers, and `stlab/pre_exit.hpp`. Public APIs retain their
`stlab::` spellings. Futures, channels, await helpers, and serial queues remain
in STLab, which publicly depends on this package.

Link `stlab::execution` from source or after
`find_package(stlab-execution CONFIG REQUIRED)`. Rebuild all consumers:
independent C++ inline namespaces do not promise old binary compatibility.
The v2 C runtime ABI and task-storage guards are preserved.

@ref stlab_concurrency documents scheduling primitives;
@ref stlab_pre_exit documents process lifecycle.
The README describes independent configuration, installation, local overrides,
and publication blockers. There is no published execution documentation site yet.

License: [Boost Software License 1.0](https://www.boost.org/LICENSE_1_0.txt).
 */
